WEBVTT

00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:03.940
Art Prep Room

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:08.580
Senpai was here a moment ago.

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:11.320
Can you tell where she went?

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:12.190
This way.

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:15.400
Sniff, sniff, sniff.

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:16.700
Sniff, sniff.

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:18.540
Sniff, sniff.

00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:20.800
There she is!

00:00:27.090 --> 00:00:28.500
Perfect timing!

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:32.770
I was having trouble moving all these alone. 
Could you help me carry some?

00:00:32.770 --> 00:00:34.590
Senpai, aren't those...

00:00:35.130 --> 00:00:36.960
Just a few.

00:00:37.340 --> 00:00:40.340
I figured I should clean up 
the prep room a little.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:43.180
You're throwing away your paintings?

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:45.900
Well, they only take up space, anyway.

00:00:46.590 --> 00:00:47.450
So why not?

00:00:49.590 --> 00:00:51.320
Senpai's acting weird.

00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:53.960
It's like she's not her usual self.

00:00:56.730 --> 00:00:58.960
We forgot to ask about Iro-chan!

00:01:00.780 --> 00:01:01.950
Cocona?

00:02:37.220 --> 00:02:40.460
Well, everyone has times when 
they just can't be bothered.

00:02:40.850 --> 00:02:42.260
Is that really it?

00:02:43.310 --> 00:02:44.980
That aside...

00:02:44.980 --> 00:02:47.520
Remember that dark hole 
you saw the other day?

00:02:48.350 --> 00:02:49.280
Yeah.

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:52.520
You shouldn't ever go near there again.

00:02:53.920 --> 00:02:54.990
Why not?

00:02:55.460 --> 00:02:58.900
The rumors say it's a tunnel that leads to Hell.

00:02:59.940 --> 00:03:02.910
Enter it again, and you might 
not be able to come back.

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:04.330
Hell?

00:03:10.790 --> 00:03:12.750
Just messing with you.

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:13.920
You jerk!

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:16.720
By the way, what'd you see in there?

00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:25.010
Senpai's memories.

00:03:28.970 --> 00:03:30.410
What now?

00:03:30.920 --> 00:03:33.230
That place really is dangerous.

00:03:35.130 --> 00:03:37.940
Did we do something?

00:03:39.040 --> 00:03:40.140
Dunno.

00:03:40.480 --> 00:03:42.120
Maybe we should ask Senpai—

00:03:44.040 --> 00:03:45.700
Okay, time for class.

00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:47.290
Head back to your classrooms.

00:03:47.290 --> 00:03:48.610
Yeah, yeah.

00:03:54.770 --> 00:03:56.090
Cocona?

00:03:57.980 --> 00:04:00.420
I love this painting, too.

00:04:00.990 --> 00:04:02.970
Well, they just take up space, anyway.

00:04:03.400 --> 00:04:05.180
I don't have the right to.

00:04:05.620 --> 00:04:06.970
Pretty, aren't they?

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:09.850
It really is weird.

00:04:10.320 --> 00:04:11.650
What, the mail folish?

00:04:12.850 --> 00:04:16.140
Singularity is...

00:04:17.300 --> 00:04:19.740
upon us!

00:04:18.940 --> 00:04:20.360
Party

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:26.010
Analyzing the spectrum you sampled 
in Pure Illusion last time

00:04:26.010 --> 00:04:29.580
gave us results that hinted at 
the existence of a deeper level!

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:31.060
Tell us, Hidaka-san!

00:04:31.060 --> 00:04:32.460
Senpai's acting weird!

00:04:31.710 --> 00:04:33.250
Just what is Pure Illusion?

00:04:33.680 --> 00:04:35.700
That hole we entered...

00:04:36.070 --> 00:04:37.750
Just what is it?!

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:42.880
Spit

00:04:40.450 --> 00:04:41.990
I'll give you the answers you seek.

00:04:43.930 --> 00:04:46.520
Pure Compitenten?

00:04:46.520 --> 00:04:47.890
Long story short...

00:04:48.090 --> 00:04:51.390
Pure Illusion is thought 
to be a kind of perception

00:04:51.390 --> 00:04:55.140
based on subject interrelationship: 
an idea world.

00:04:55.140 --> 00:04:58.520
It's not limited to humans alone. 
All kinds of existences fall under its radar.

00:04:58.520 --> 00:05:00.650
This is a mission that will 
greatly impact our world.

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:04.860
We must always take the 
initiative and fully commit

00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:06.910
to driving the agenda!

00:05:08.520 --> 00:05:10.700
Yeah, that was still over my head.

00:05:11.470 --> 00:05:14.960
In other words, Pure Illusion, 
which only you girls can go to,

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:18.340
is an uncharted world that exists 
in a dimension adjacent to ours!

00:05:18.650 --> 00:05:20.920
So you don't know, either?

00:05:21.190 --> 00:05:23.170
It's currently under investigation!

00:05:23.540 --> 00:05:26.660
Then, that dark hole we entered...

00:05:26.660 --> 00:05:27.700
Yes!

00:05:27.700 --> 00:05:30.850
That's the deeper level of 
Pure Illusion we observed this time!

00:05:31.320 --> 00:05:36.230
A critical area that can have 
ripple effects on our world.

00:05:36.560 --> 00:05:39.040
Any unusual changes in our world are likely

00:05:39.040 --> 00:05:41.650
to have been caused by that ripple effect.

00:05:42.280 --> 00:05:44.570
So it really was our fault.

00:05:44.570 --> 00:05:46.580
Wait, do you know something?!

00:05:46.580 --> 00:05:49.080
It could be a precious research subject!

00:05:49.080 --> 00:05:50.090
Cocona?

00:05:50.090 --> 00:05:51.760
Oh, no!

00:05:51.760 --> 00:05:54.580
But if we do change anything,

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:56.250
will we be able to return it to normal?

00:05:57.620 --> 00:05:59.520
I wouldn't say it'd be impossible,

00:05:59.520 --> 00:06:03.710
but, frankly, there's still too much
we don't know about all this.

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:05.060
But...

00:06:05.560 --> 00:06:08.050
I thought Pure Illusion was 
another world entirely.

00:06:08.050 --> 00:06:12.220
All worlds, including Pure Illusion, 
should interact fluidly with one another.

00:06:16.970 --> 00:06:19.620
But that's not true in reality.

00:06:20.120 --> 00:06:23.210
There's no such thing as a frictionless utopia.

00:06:24.540 --> 00:06:27.060
Friction is the foundation 
upon which all is built.

00:06:29.080 --> 00:06:30.250
What's wrong?

00:06:31.090 --> 00:06:32.720
Cocona, wait!

00:06:36.720 --> 00:06:39.000
There's no time left for hesitation.

00:06:42.040 --> 00:06:44.040
Lemme go, Bu-chan!

00:06:45.290 --> 00:06:48.370
Not just anyone can go to Pure Illusion.

00:06:48.370 --> 00:06:52.050
You two attract fragments, so you gotta 
put in the legwork and collect them!

00:06:52.050 --> 00:06:54.460
I won't let you bully Cocona!

00:06:54.460 --> 00:06:56.810
I hate both of you, Salt and Hidaka!

00:06:57.520 --> 00:06:58.730
Cocona...

00:07:00.160 --> 00:07:01.890
Did you know?

00:07:01.890 --> 00:07:03.100
No.

00:07:06.900 --> 00:07:09.610
I don't want to go to Pure Illusion anymore.

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:13.960
But collecting fragments might 
help turn Senpai back to normal.

00:07:14.300 --> 00:07:15.990
But what are these fragments?

00:07:15.990 --> 00:07:18.040
Can they really grant wishes?

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:19.400
Probably.

00:07:19.620 --> 00:07:21.450
That's not much of an answer.

00:07:21.860 --> 00:07:22.760
Yeah...

00:07:24.730 --> 00:07:25.760
I'm sorry.

00:07:26.620 --> 00:07:29.920
But I'm afraid we might 
change something again.

00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:33.000
We'll be fine if we stay away from that hole!

00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:34.670
But we don't know that.

00:07:36.570 --> 00:07:39.560
I'll catch you if you're about to fall.

00:07:40.970 --> 00:07:42.140
I can't.

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:46.000
Cocona?

00:07:47.770 --> 00:07:48.930
Sigh...

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:54.060
Huh?

00:07:55.540 --> 00:07:56.950
Look at the time.

00:07:56.950 --> 00:07:57.870
I have to get home.

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:04.770
I'm back.

00:08:08.990 --> 00:08:10.510
I'm home, Uexkull.

00:08:15.240 --> 00:08:16.620
Grandma?

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:28.760
Sis!

00:08:28.760 --> 00:08:29.730
Who's there?

00:08:31.920 --> 00:08:33.490
Dinner's ready.

00:08:34.730 --> 00:08:35.660
Papika?

00:08:35.950 --> 00:08:39.890
Let's eat together, Sis!

00:08:42.810 --> 00:08:44.880
Come on, Sis.

00:08:44.880 --> 00:08:46.580
Eat up while it's still hot.

00:08:46.970 --> 00:08:49.590
But what are you doing here, Papika?

00:08:49.590 --> 00:08:51.710
And where are Grandma and Uexkull...

00:08:55.240 --> 00:08:56.680
Wait, what's the matter?

00:08:57.350 --> 00:08:59.680
The food's getting cold...

00:09:00.010 --> 00:09:02.020
Fine! I'll eat!

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:02.970
See?

00:09:03.890 --> 00:09:05.230
It doesn't taste bad?

00:09:05.230 --> 00:09:06.900
No, this is great!

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:08.760
Thanks, Papika.

00:09:11.460 --> 00:09:12.570
Welks.

00:09:13.430 --> 00:09:15.070
Welks?

00:09:15.670 --> 00:09:17.020
Gimme that, Sis.

00:09:17.020 --> 00:09:17.820
Wait...

00:09:18.250 --> 00:09:20.770
I'm in charge of washing your back.

00:09:20.770 --> 00:09:22.110
Thanks...

00:09:22.110 --> 00:09:25.790
But could you stop calling me "Sis"?

00:09:27.780 --> 00:09:30.000
I'm not good enough?

00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:34.490
No, no!

00:09:34.490 --> 00:09:36.630
You can call me "Sis" all you like, so don't cry.

00:09:37.110 --> 00:09:37.960
Okay?

00:09:40.960 --> 00:09:42.220
Welks.

00:09:44.780 --> 00:09:46.520
Hurry up, please.

00:09:50.260 --> 00:09:52.210
Want to stay over tonight?

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:56.790
Papika?

00:09:59.040 --> 00:10:00.820
Papika, are you here?

00:10:01.580 --> 00:10:03.700
Jeez, she does whatever she wants.

00:10:12.120 --> 00:10:13.460
I'm off.

00:10:36.500 --> 00:10:37.860
Nobody's here.

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:47.910
What?

00:10:48.180 --> 00:10:50.570
Jerk! You did that on purpose!

00:10:51.520 --> 00:10:52.800
Busted, huh?

00:10:55.380 --> 00:10:57.850
This is Pure Illusion, isn't it?

00:10:57.850 --> 00:10:58.720
Yeah.

00:10:59.280 --> 00:11:01.260
Take this seriously—

00:11:02.180 --> 00:11:03.590
Shh.

00:11:03.590 --> 00:11:06.120
Our classmates are gonna get here soon.

00:11:07.040 --> 00:11:09.110
Let's take this chance to get outta school

00:11:09.110 --> 00:11:10.660
and play hooky together.

00:11:12.780 --> 00:11:13.810
Hup.

00:11:14.390 --> 00:11:16.230
What if someone sees us?

00:11:18.560 --> 00:11:20.770
Jeez, you're hopeless.

00:11:21.810 --> 00:11:23.100
Hurry it up.

00:11:29.260 --> 00:11:30.430
Again?

00:11:32.560 --> 00:11:34.290
So this really is...

00:11:45.400 --> 00:11:47.680
Excuse me.

00:12:10.300 --> 00:12:12.000
You think you can just look in there?

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:14.320
B-But it was open!

00:12:16.100 --> 00:12:17.350
Not gonna look inside?

00:12:18.270 --> 00:12:19.900
Wanna look together?

00:12:19.900 --> 00:12:23.000
I... guess so?

00:12:30.780 --> 00:12:32.180
A nail clipper?

00:12:54.880 --> 00:12:57.180
You build one, too, Cocona-san.

00:12:58.060 --> 00:12:59.080
All done.

00:13:07.980 --> 00:13:10.510
Destroy yours, too, Cocona-san!

00:13:16.130 --> 00:13:17.320
Well?

00:13:17.320 --> 00:13:19.090
That felt good, didn't it?

00:13:19.450 --> 00:13:20.600
A little.

00:13:20.600 --> 00:13:22.300
That's the way!

00:13:22.530 --> 00:13:25.030
Fashion Center
Motomiya

00:13:23.340 --> 00:13:25.030
Come on, sit still!

00:13:26.160 --> 00:13:27.280
There you go.

00:13:27.470 --> 00:13:29.910
It ain't even a scratch.

00:13:30.360 --> 00:13:32.220
Your clothes are a mess...

00:13:34.490 --> 00:13:36.090
I just had a great idea.

00:13:37.770 --> 00:13:39.540
What would be good?

00:13:43.300 --> 00:13:44.810
You look cute.

00:13:44.810 --> 00:13:47.140
I don't wanna wear this dorky crap.

00:13:48.320 --> 00:13:49.880
My turn now.

00:13:53.120 --> 00:13:54.810
That looks great on ya.

00:13:54.980 --> 00:13:56.160
You meanie!

00:13:56.490 --> 00:13:57.390
Here.

00:13:59.150 --> 00:14:00.270
Wear this now.

00:14:02.930 --> 00:14:04.760
How do I look?

00:14:06.390 --> 00:14:07.420
Lookin' good.

00:14:07.800 --> 00:14:09.110
Not bad at all.

00:14:09.110 --> 00:14:10.210
Really?

00:14:25.340 --> 00:14:26.840
Pick up here

00:14:26.840 --> 00:14:28.840
Cocona

00:14:26.840 --> 00:14:28.840
Uexkull

00:14:26.840 --> 00:14:28.840
BFFs

00:14:26.840 --> 00:14:28.840
First Photo Sticker

00:14:26.840 --> 00:14:28.840
Papika

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:31.130
I could just die.

00:14:31.600 --> 00:14:32.850
Let's take another.

00:14:32.850 --> 00:14:34.260
Pick up here

00:14:34.260 --> 00:14:36.640
#Date

00:14:34.260 --> 00:14:36.640
MAX

00:14:34.260 --> 00:14:36.640
Excitement!

00:14:34.860 --> 00:14:36.640
Do I look good in this one?

00:14:36.910 --> 00:14:38.670
Y-Yeah.

00:14:38.670 --> 00:14:40.000
Huh?

00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:41.600
Hm?

00:14:41.600 --> 00:14:43.030
Gasp!

00:14:43.030 --> 00:14:44.330
Gasp...

00:15:18.700 --> 00:15:21.200
Sheesh, where'd she go?

00:15:22.970 --> 00:15:25.680
I never even wanted to come here.

00:15:27.300 --> 00:15:28.130
Yo.

00:15:28.130 --> 00:15:29.280
Papika?!

00:15:31.150 --> 00:15:32.860
Who are you this time?

00:15:32.860 --> 00:15:34.280
I looked all over for you.

00:15:34.830 --> 00:15:37.160
Jeez, don't worry me like that.

00:15:38.440 --> 00:15:39.580
Thanks.

00:15:43.260 --> 00:15:45.090
That feels good!

00:15:50.000 --> 00:15:51.580
A pretty boy, seriously?

00:16:01.580 --> 00:16:03.680
What the heck am I doing?

00:16:09.230 --> 00:16:10.650
I'm tired of it all.

00:16:12.210 --> 00:16:14.170
Maybe I should just stay here.

00:16:15.040 --> 00:16:17.660
But I have to turn Senpai back to normal.

00:16:18.240 --> 00:16:19.970
Is change so bad?

00:16:20.660 --> 00:16:21.870
That's not what I...

00:16:22.500 --> 00:16:26.880
No matter how much you change, 
I'll always love you.

00:16:27.400 --> 00:16:28.630
What about you?

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:32.120
Do I love you?

00:16:32.500 --> 00:16:33.550
I don't know.

00:16:34.180 --> 00:16:35.340
Why not?

00:16:36.400 --> 00:16:39.100
Because you're not the Papika I know.

00:16:39.450 --> 00:16:42.530
Does it <i>have</i> to be the Papika you know?

00:16:42.860 --> 00:16:44.850
That's not what I mean...

00:16:45.510 --> 00:16:48.280
Do you love me, then?

00:16:48.920 --> 00:16:50.770
You mean as a friend, right?

00:16:52.000 --> 00:16:54.070
Why would you ask that?

00:16:55.180 --> 00:16:58.060
I mean, love is...

00:16:58.530 --> 00:16:59.490
Say...

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:02.400
What?

00:17:14.330 --> 00:17:19.090
How about we forget everything 
and do something fun?

00:17:20.530 --> 00:17:24.330
But I have to look for my lost friend.

00:17:25.300 --> 00:17:26.940
Am I not good enough?

00:17:27.570 --> 00:17:29.420
This place is fun,

00:17:29.980 --> 00:17:31.440
but I need to get back.

00:17:32.660 --> 00:17:33.940
Too bad.

00:17:34.320 --> 00:17:35.590
How boring.

00:17:49.200 --> 00:17:50.790
I have to look for Papika.

00:18:31.490 --> 00:18:32.490
Let's get going.

00:18:37.290 --> 00:18:40.010
What if I can never go back?

00:18:44.410 --> 00:18:45.610
Really...

00:18:49.590 --> 00:18:52.850
Papika, you jerk!

00:18:56.570 --> 00:18:57.550
You jerk...

00:18:59.080 --> 00:19:00.770
Where'd you go?

00:19:17.610 --> 00:19:18.860
Papika!

00:19:28.520 --> 00:19:30.480
I found my lost Cocona!

00:19:31.790 --> 00:19:33.870
What are you saying?

00:19:33.870 --> 00:19:35.310
The one who was lost...

00:19:40.230 --> 00:19:41.320
Nothing.

00:19:41.970 --> 00:19:43.740
I looked all over for you!

00:20:05.030 --> 00:20:06.510
Outta my way.

00:20:06.510 --> 00:20:08.350
Why can't I go in?

00:20:08.350 --> 00:20:12.060
The security level has been modified.

00:20:12.060 --> 00:20:14.210
You are not authorized to go beyond here.

00:20:14.210 --> 00:20:16.750
I can't do anything without information!

00:20:17.100 --> 00:20:20.150
I was the only one who didn't 
know about that hole!

00:20:20.150 --> 00:20:24.140
You can't find any amorphous 
unless you follow someone,

00:20:24.140 --> 00:20:26.660
and you're inferior to 
the amorphous children.

00:20:27.050 --> 00:20:28.780
If you disobey us,

00:20:28.780 --> 00:20:30.800
you will have no place here.

00:20:37.030 --> 00:20:38.250
Feel it?

00:20:38.250 --> 00:20:39.000
Yeah.

00:20:43.390 --> 00:20:45.800
Not many left now.

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:10.490
You're heavy, Papika.

00:21:15.230 --> 00:21:16.320
All done.

00:21:16.690 --> 00:21:18.130
Here, Cocona.

00:21:18.670 --> 00:21:19.840
Thanks.

00:21:20.180 --> 00:21:21.110
Lemme see it.

00:21:21.580 --> 00:21:22.860
Put it here.

00:21:25.240 --> 00:21:26.550
It smells nice!

00:21:34.640 --> 00:21:36.980
Papika, the fragment's shining.

00:21:37.410 --> 00:21:38.660
You're right.

00:21:41.670 --> 00:21:42.280
Mimi!

00:21:42.800 --> 00:21:44.530
Mimi!

00:21:45.390 --> 00:21:46.570
I'm sorry.

00:21:49.510 --> 00:21:50.650
Papika?

00:21:52.650 --> 00:21:53.640
Mimi...

00:21:54.430 --> 00:21:55.410
Mimi?

00:23:30.820 --> 00:23:32.140
A game to decide who says it?

00:23:32.460 --> 00:23:33.200
Sure.

00:23:33.530 --> 00:23:35.030
Rock, paper, scissors.

00:23:35.030 --> 00:23:36.540
One more go.

00:23:36.540 --> 00:23:38.140
One more go.

00:23:36.760 --> 00:23:39.770
Pure Breaker

00:23:38.140 --> 00:23:39.080
Faceplant.
